---
title: Translate selected text from the Chrome extension
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant P as Web page
    participant BG as Extension service worker
    participant SP as Side panel
    participant SEC as Jakarta Security (Basic mechanism + IdentityStore)
    participant R as TranslatorResource
    participant S as TranslationService
    participant L as LlmClient (Gemini / Ollama)

    U->>P: select text, right-click
    U->>BG: "Translate to Darija" (context menu)
    BG->>SP: chrome.sidePanel.open()
    BG->>P: scripting.executeScript(getSelection)
    P-->>BG: selected text
    BG->>SP: storage.session.set(pendingText)
    SP->>SP: paste text into input
    SP->>SEC: POST /api/translate + Authorization: Basic
    alt invalid credentials
        SEC-->>SP: 401 Unauthorized
        SP-->>U: show "wrong username or password"
    else valid user in role translator
        SEC->>R: forward request
        R->>S: translate(request)
        alt cached
            S-->>R: cached translation
        else not cached
            S->>L: complete(systemPrompt, text)
            L-->>S: Darija text
            S->>S: cleanOutput() + cache
        end
        R-->>SP: 200 JSON {translation, script, model...}
        SP-->>U: show translation (RTL)
        opt read aloud / voice mode
            SP->>SP: speechSynthesis.speak(ar-MA)
        end
    end
